      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[3].taskReminderText
      value: Press 'E' to detach the Conductor and start digging and attacking if
        neccesary!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[4].pages.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[4].taskReminderText
      value: Order all your units to dig through the rocky wall. You can detach the
        Conductor and help clear the blockade.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[5].pages.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[5].taskReminderText
      value: Move all surviving units to the exit zone.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[3].pages.Array.data[0].title
      value: UNIT VITALS
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[4].pages.Array.data[0].title
      value: ENVIROMENTAL HAZARDS
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[4].pages.Array.data[1].title
      value: SWARM CLASSES
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[4].pages.Array.data[2].title
      value: ABILITIES
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[4].pages.Array.data[3].title
      value: THE HOLLOW CONDUCTOR
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[4].pages.Array.data[4].title
      value: ADVANCED MOVEMENT
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[5].pages.Array.data[0].title
      value: SURVIVE AND ADAPT
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[3].pages.Array.data[0].explanationText
      value: "Every robot is driven by specific internal systems. \nKeep a close
        eye on them: \n\nEnergy: Drains passively over time and drops faster when
        acting. If it hits 0, the robot shuts down permanently! \n\nHP (Health):
        Lost in combat or from hazards. If it reaches 0, the robot is destroyed.
        \n\nInventory: Defines how many items a unit can carry before becoming overloaded."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[4].pages.Array.data[0].explanationText
      value: "Occasionally, you will encounter massive hazards that you cannot simply
        bypass. \n\nWhen faced with a collapsed wall, you must commit your entire
        Swarm's workforce to break through before the tunnel catches up!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[4].pages.Array.data[1].explanationText
      value: "Your robotic companions are specialized for specific tasks to optimize
        Energy usage:\n\nDiggers: Masters of excavation. They consume less Energy
        while mining. \n\nDefenders: Built for combat. They burn less Energy during
        engagements. \n\nSpecialists: Equipped with unique abilities, which they
        cast at a reduced Energy cost.\n\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[4].pages.Array.data[2].explanationText
      value: "Some robots possess powerful active skills! \nSelect the unit and press
        RMP or Spacebar on them to aim and activate their unique ability using RMP
        again!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[4].pages.Array.data[3].explanationText
      value: "Your main character, the Conductor, cannot fight or mine directly.
        However, its special ability allows the Spider-Constructor to detach from
        the puppet body! \n\nWhile detached, the Spider can perform basic actions,
        but you lose the ability to command the rest of the Swarm. Use this tool
        wisely!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[4].pages.Array.data[4].explanationText
      value: "To improve your multitasking, you can move the Conductor independently
        using \u201DWSAD\u201D, and quickly activate its Detachment ability by pressing
        \u201CE\u201D. To go back to your puppet's body just press \"E\" again.\n\nRemember
        that when spider moves out of the screen boundaries (either when on the puppet
        body or on its own) the game instantly ends!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6040056607672438406, guid: 3ddfb414c2d6e1d429b1218438d32362, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[5].pages.Array.data[0].explanationText
      value: "Excellent! \n\nYou have grasped the core mechanics of survival. I won't
        reveal all the secrets of Aion just yet... \n\nFor now, let's catch our breath
        before the real hunt begins. See you in the Asylum!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
